<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  Entitlements for the signed macPaper.app (scripts/bundle.sh).

  The app is not sandboxed: it writes wallpapers and exports where the user
  asks, hands files to NSWorkspace, and registers a global hotkey. The
  hardened runtime is enabled on the codesign command line with no
  exceptions: macPaper loads no frameworks, plug-ins or JIT, and asks macOS
  for no permissions.
-->
